      "hints": [
        "Recall the named law that relates the force on a spring to its extension in the proportional region."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "For a spring within its proportional limit, applied force is proportional to extension.",
        "This force–extension relationship is Hooke's law."
      ],
